WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
First, let's find your hourly floor, the lowest price that still pays you.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Add your yearly costs and the pay you need.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Divide by the hours you can actually bill.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Then add your profit margin on top.
